WEBVTT

00:06:59.633 --> 00:07:02.648
how about a 577R genotype?

00:07:02.648 --> 00:07:07.348
Well it turns out that every male Olympic power athelete ever tested

00:07:07.348 --> 00:07:10.598
carries at least one of these variants.

00:07:10.598 --> 00:07:12.252
If that is true,

00:07:12.252 --> 00:07:14.410
it leads to some very complicated questions

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.211
for the London Olympics.

00:07:16.211 --> 00:07:17.730
Three options:

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.562
Do you want the Olympics to be a showcase

00:07:20.562 --> 00:07:23.262
for really hardworking mutants?

00:07:23.262 --> 00:07:24.995
(Laughter)

00:07:24.995 --> 00:07:27.730
Option number two:

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:31.128
Why don't we play it like golf or sailing?